flowchart TD
    START([用户消息进入]) --> AGENT[agent 节点\n理解意图、更新 DesignState]

    AGENT -->|信息不足| REPLY[直接回复用户\n继续追问设计细节]
    REPLY --> END_REPLY([本轮结束 · stop])

    AGENT -->|ready_to_generate = true| RAG_GATE[rag_gate 节点\n按规则判断是否检索相似案例]
    AGENT -->|ready_to_generate = false| END_COLLECT([本轮结束 · stop])

    RAG_GATE --> ENHANCE[enhance_prompt 节点\n构建正向/负向提示词]
    ENHANCE --> GENERATE["generate_image 节点\n1. 提交 Celery 任务\n2. 轮询 Redis result backend\n3. 检查 cancel:{session_id}:{run_id}"]

    GENERATE -->|用户发来新消息\n旧 run 被置 cancel flag| INTERRUPTED[当前 run 中断]
    INTERRUPTED --> END_INTERRUPTED([本轮结束 · interrupted])

    GENERATE -->|生成成功| EVALUATE[evaluate_image 节点\nVLM 多维度打分]
    EVALUATE -->|score < 0.8 且 retry_count < 3| REFINE[refine_prompt 节点\n根据评估结果修正提示词]
    REFINE --> GENERATE

    EVALUATE -->|score >= 0.8\n或 retry_count == 3| RETURN_RESULT[返回 best_generation_result]
    RETURN_RESULT --> END_RESULT([本轮结束 · stop / max_retries])

    FRONTEND[前端图片卡片\n操作按钮区] -->|用户点击「存入图库」| STORE_API["POST /api/library/store\n独立 REST 接口"]
    STORE_API --> MCP[store_generated_image · MCP\n存 PostgreSQL + Milvus]
